{"uid": "own/0004", "dataset": "own", "topic": "proportionality", "model_alias": "opus", "model_id": "claude-opus-5-5", "answer_ref": "32", "answer_extracted": "32", "correct": true, "grade_method": "exact", "input_tokens": 107, "output_tokens": 92, "cost_usd": 0.002268, "latency_s": 1.769171953201294, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "from_cache": false, "output_text": "At the same rate, the yield is proportional to the area.\n\n1. Yield per hectare: 12 tons ÷ 3 hectares = 4 tons per hectare.\n2. Yield for 8 hectares: 8 × 4 = 32 tons.\n\n\\boxed{32}"}
{"uid": "own/0006", "dataset": "own", "topic": "geometry", "model_alias": "haiku", "model_id": "claude-haiku-5-5", "answer_ref": "26", "answer_extracted": "26", "correct": true, "grade_method": "exact", "input_tokens": 104, "output_tokens": 81, "cost_usd": 5.0900000000000004e-05, "latency_s": 0.951324462890625, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "from_cache": false, "output_text": "The perimeter of a rectangle is the total distance around it, given by P = 2(width + length).\n\nWidth = 5 m, length = 8 m.\n\nP = 2(5 + 8) = 2(13) = 26 meters.\n\n\\boxed{26}"}
